e": "string"}], "size": [345.083251953125, 265.3735656738281], "pos": [390.3290710449219, 366.7533874511719], "widgets_values": ["Using the reference image as the sole scene baseline, strictly preserve the subject, composition, pose, environment, and narrative content unchanged. Redesign the lighting in a restrained, cinematic manner. Do NOT globally brighten the image. Select and execute ONLY ONE of the following directions with precision:\nDirection A: Darken the background and most of the environment, creating a clean backlight or rear three-quarter rim light to strongly separate the subject from the dark background.\nDirection B: Lower the overall exposure and build the scene around a single, physically credible local light source (e.g., a light beam, chandelier, wall sconce, desk lamp, diffused doorway light, or sign light). Illuminate only the targeted areas while deliberately keeping the rest of the scene in deep shadow.\nIntroduce extremely subtle atmospheric depth: add only faint, controlled volumetric rays or micro-dust strictly visible within realistic light paths.\nApply a refined black diffusion (pro-mist) effect: let highlights bloom softly with a delicate, subtle glow and slight light spread, accurately simulating optical lens and film characteristics rather than digital overlays. Keep the effect restrained and premium.\nShape light more purposefully across facial structures, hair edges, fabrics, and reflective surfaces to enhance three-dimensional form. Preserve deep, clean, and detail-rich shadows alongside soft yet structurally defined highlights.\nEnsure all lighting adheres strictly to physical logic, originating exclusively from existing or logically inferable sources within the scene. Do not introduce unrelated light sources.\nStrictly avoid: foggy gray washes, crushed/dead blacks, excessive bloom, artificial HDR looks, over-sharpening, or fake lens flares.\nMatch the reference image’s subject features, composition, camera position, light ratio, and overall color tone, while shifting toward a darker, mood-driven cinematic lighting style with subtle atmosphere and refined optical softening.\nStrictly prohibit adding any watermarks, logos, subtitles, UI elements, borders, QR codes, signatures, or extraneous text."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 17, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [27], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "INT"}], "size": [348.6842041015625, 61.42100524902344], "pos": [-183.29331970214844, 648.0114135742188], "widgets_values": [2], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 32, "type": "Int", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Int"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [28], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "image_url", "label": "image_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [462.0313415527344, 752.9839477539062], "pos": [219.15908813476562, -23.968050003051758], "widgets_values": ["", 1059812410, "randomize", "16:9", "2k", false, "Third-party"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 9, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "imag